ance3D object.\n4. Assign the script to it.\n5. Drag the blend file into a scene and inspect the connects of the blend file.\n\nResults:\n\n<img width=\"915\" height=\"395\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31d4d772-8dcc-4ef6-a6a8-d86168681dab\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123974/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}